  找到：ImmersiveEngineering=[沉浸工程] ImmersiveEngineering-1.21.1-12.4.2-194.jar, ImmersivePetroleum=[沉浸原油] ImmersivePetroleum-1.21.1-4.5.0-39.jar, Mekanism-=[通用机械] Mekanism-1.21.1-10.7.19.85.jar, MekanismGenerators=[通用机械发电机] MekanismGenerators-1.21.1-10.7.19.85.jar
